{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Honestly, that sounds fascinating to watch. The dancing part, definitely.' she blushes a little. 'As for the rest, isn't that technically on them if they picture it?'","created_at":"2021-08-24T06:38:10.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879615553206095922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
